@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-36 - Add Carrier + Tracking

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-36
FE -> API: PATCH /payments/orders/:orderCode/fulfillment
API -> Service: Execute Add Carrier + Tracking
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Carrier và tracking code được thêm

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đơn hàng đang ở status PACKING hoặc SHIPPING
Post: Carrier và tracking code được thêm
Main flow:
1. Admin nhập tên carrier (VD: Giao Hàng Nhanh, Viettel Post)
2. Admin nhập tracking code
3. System gọi API PATCH /payments/orders/:orderCode/fulfillment
4. System lưu thông tin, gửi email cho khách
end note
@enduml
